[{"title":"失调名","author":"文及翁","text":"朗吟飞过。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5516,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺新郎 西湖","author":"文及翁","text":"一勺西湖水。\n渡江来、百年歌舞，百年酣醉。\n回首洛阳花世界，烟渺黍离之地。\n更不复、新亭堕泪。\n簇乐红妆摇画艇，问中流、击楫谁人是。\n千古恨，几时洗。\n余生自负澄清志。\n更有谁、磻溪未遇，傅岩未起。\n国事如今谁倚仗，衣带一江而已。\n便都道、江神堪恃。\n借问孤山林处士，但掉头、笑指梅花蕊。\n天下事，可知矣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5517,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"澹山岩","author":"文子璋","text":"舟舣澹岩前，岩扃不记年。\n台高先得月，石透可通天。\n洞古依禅刹，碑残纪昔贤。\n胜游回首望，林麓锁云烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5518,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浯溪","author":"文子璋","text":"漫郎直笔老文□，太师□字尤卓荦。\n天然二妙刻苍崖，墨本传来重和璞。\n三年流客居潇嶷，甚欲一来观此碑。\n尽被前贤刚说破，手磨苔刻难为辞。\n为子从来止于孝，古以敝屣匹天下。\n□□神武妖氛清，南内凄凉泪血洒。\n一时大业中兴唐，万世□□□虎狼。\n从今罪案休拈起，祇挹□□与元郎。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5519,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别黄山","author":"文天祐","text":"黄山别去恨绵绵，华表重寻第几巅。\n马迹苔肥连碧汉，龙潭水暖涨灵泉。\n断无花逐桃溪外，别有春留药圃边。\n鶗鴂一声人亦老，鬓丝惊笑玉颜仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5520,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄山听琴","author":"文天祐","text":"岁晏抱琴入室处，榾柮烧残听风雨。\n有客五弦弹太古，扫空恩怨不儿女。\n污樽抔饮击土鼓，如与羲轩相对语。\n又如重华坐舜皋，万物长养不苦窳。\n闻君澹然太古音，感君悠悠太古心。\n古心古音谁能识，应向松涛处处寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5521,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二女第一百五十","author":"文天祥","text":"痴女饥咬我，郁没一悲魂。\n不得收骨肉，痛哭苍烟根。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5522,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二王","author":"文天祥","text":"一马渡江开晋土，五龙夹日复唐天。\n内家苗裔真隆准，虏运从来无百年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5523,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月十六日见梅","author":"文天祥","text":"广寒殿里玉楼开，那得孤山处士来。\n半夜西风半身影，梦中骑得雪驴回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5524,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又二绝 其二","author":"文天祥","text":"病中忽误通真理，静处专寻入定工。\n雨汗淋头都不管，须臾和气自冲融。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5525,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又三绝 其三","author":"文天祥","text":"老来忧患易凄凉，说到悲秋更断肠。\n世事不堪逢九九，休言今日是重阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5526,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又三绝 其一","author":"文天祥","text":"世事濛濛醉不知，南山秋意满东篱。\n黄花何故无颜色，应为元嘉以后诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5527,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又三绝 其二","author":"文天祥","text":"人间万事转头空，皂帽飘萧一病翁。\n不学孟嘉狂落魄，故将白发向西风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5528,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又送前人琴棋书画四首 其一 琴","author":"文天祥","text":"不知甲子定何年，题满柴桑日醉眠。\n意不在言君解否，壁间琴本是无弦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5529,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又送前人琴棋书画四首 其二 棋","author":"文天祥","text":"我爱商山茹紫芝，逍遥胜似橘中时。\n纷纷玄白方龙战，世事从他一局棋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5530,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又送前人琴棋书画四首 其三 书","author":"文天祥","text":"蔡邕去后右军死，谁是风流入品题。\n只少蛟龙大师字，至今风骨在浯溪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5531,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又送前人琴棋书画四首 其四 画","author":"文天祥","text":"欲觅龙眠旧时事，相传此本世间无。\n黄金不买昭君本，只买严陵归钓图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5532,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山中偶成","author":"文天祥","text":"白鹤飞来牵我衣，东风吹我下渔矶。\n当年祇为青山误，直草君王一诏归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5533,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"马祖岩","author":"文天祥","text":"曾将飞锡破苔痕，一片云根锁洞门。\n山外人家山下路，石头心事付无言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5534,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云端","author":"文天祥","text":"半空夭矫起层台，传道刘安车马来。\n山上自晴山下雨，倚阑平立看风雷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5535,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天下赵","author":"文天祥","text":"皇王著姓复炎图，此是中兴受命符。\n独向迎銮呈瑞字，为言艺祖有灵无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5536,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太白楼 其二","author":"文天祥","text":"扬子江心第一泉，南金来此铸文渊。\n男儿斩却楼兰首，闲品茶经拜羽仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5537,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"月夜","author":"文天祥","text":"月到中天云划开，断桥幻出玉楼台。\n夜深一鹤掠舟过，疑是坡仙赤壁来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5538,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"气概","author":"文天祥","text":"气概如虹俺得知，留吴那肯竖降旗。\n北人不解欺心语，正恐南人作浅窥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5539,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"邓礼部第一百三十七","author":"文天祥","text":"南宫吾故人，才名三十年。\n江城秋日落，此别意苍然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5540,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长子第一百四十九","author":"文天祥","text":"大儿聪明到，青岁已摧颓。\n回风吹独树，吾宁舍一哀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5541,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出使第五十六","author":"文天祥","text":"隔河见胡骑，朝进东门营。\n皇皇使臣体，词气浩纵横。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5542,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出真州 其一","author":"文天祥","text":"早约戎装去看城，联镳壕上叹风尘。\n谁知关出西门外，憔悴世间无告人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5543,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出真州 其十","author":"文天祥","text":"戎衣啧啧叹忠臣，为说城头不识人。\n押出相公州界去，真州城里榜安民。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5544,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出真州 其六","author":"文天祥","text":"天地沉沉夜溯舟，鬼神未觉走何州。\n明朝遣间应无是，莫恐元戎逐客不。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5545,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出真州 其八","author":"文天祥","text":"千金犯险脱旃裘，谁料南冠反见雠。\n记取小西门外事，年年上巳哭江头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5546,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出真州 其九","author":"文天祥","text":"荒郊下马问何之，死活元来任便宜。\n不是白兵生眼孔，一团冤血有谁知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5547,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出真州 其五","author":"文天祥","text":"一别迎銮十八秋，重来意气落旄头。\n平山老子不收拾，南望端门泪雨流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5548,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出真州 其四","author":"文天祥","text":"秦庭痛哭血成川，翻讶中行背可鞭。\n南北共知忠义苦，平生只少两淮缘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5549,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出真州 其三","author":"文天祥","text":"琼花堂上意茫然，志士忠臣泪彻泉。\n赖有使君知义者，人方欲杀我犹怜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5550,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出真州 其十三","author":"文天祥","text":"真州送骏已回城，暗里依随马垛行。\n一阵西州三十里，摘星楼下打初更。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5551,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出真州 其二","author":"文天祥","text":"扬州昨夜有人来，误把忠良按剑猜。\n怪道使君无见解，城门前日不应开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5552,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出真州 其七","author":"文天祥","text":"人人争劝走淮西，莫犯翁翁按剑疑。\n我问平山堂下路，忠臣见诎有天知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5553,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出真州 其十一","author":"文天祥","text":"有客仓皇欲赴壕，一行性命等鸿毛。\n白兵送我扬州去，惟恐北军来捉逃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5554,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"北海口","author":"文天祥","text":"沧海人间别一天，只容渔父钓苍烟。\n而今蜃起楼台处，亦有北来蕃汉船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5555,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"发海陵","author":"文天祥","text":"自海陵来向海安，分明如渡鬼门关。\n若将九折回车看，倦鸟何年可得还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5556,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"发通州 其一","author":"文天祥","text":"孤舟渐渐脱长淮，星斗当空月照怀。\n今夜分明栖海角，未应便道是天涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5557,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"发通州 其二","author":"文天祥","text":"白骨丛中过一春，东将入海避风尘。\n姓名变尽形容改，犹有天涯相识人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5558,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"发通州 其三","author":"文天祥","text":"淮水淮山阻且长，孤臣性命寄何乡。\n只从海上寻归路，便是当年不死方。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5559,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"发高沙 其三","author":"文天祥","text":"一日经行白骨堆，中流失柁为心摧。\n海陵棹子长狼顾，水有船来步马来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5560,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"发高沙 其一","author":"文天祥","text":"晓发高沙卧一航，平沙漠漠水茫茫。\n舟人为指荒烟岸，南北今年几战场。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5561,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"发高沙 其四","author":"文天祥","text":"小泊稽庄月正弦，庄官惊问是何船。\n今朝哨马湾头出，正在青山大路边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5562,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汀州第六十五","author":"文天祥","text":"雷霆走精锐，斧钺下青冥。\n江城今夜客，惨淡飞云汀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5563,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"议纠合两淮复兴 其一","author":"文天祥","text":"清边堂上老将军，南望天家雨湿巾。\n为道两淮兵定出，相公同作歃盟人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5564,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"议纠合两淮复兴 其三","author":"文天祥","text":"南八空归唐垒陷，包胥一出楚疆还。\n而今庙社存亡决，只看元戎进退间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5565,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"议纠合两淮复兴 其二","author":"文天祥","text":"扬州兵了约庐州，某向瓜洲某鹭洲。\n直下南徐侯自管，皇亲刺史统千舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5566,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"刘沐第一百二十","author":"文天祥","text":"王翰愿卜邻，嵇康不得死。\n落月满屋梁，悲风为我起。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5567,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"刘监簿第一百二十九","author":"文天祥","text":"艰难奋长戟，高义薄曾云。\n死为殊方鬼，三夜频梦君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5568,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"刘监簿第一百三十","author":"文天祥","text":"秀气冲星斗，壮笔过飞泉。\n旧游易磨灭，魂伤山寂然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5569,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吉州第八十一","author":"文天祥","text":"泊舟沧江岸，身轻一鸟过。\n请为父老歌，歌长击樽破。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5570,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"如皋","author":"文天祥","text":"雄狐假虎之林皋，河水腥风接海涛。\n行客不知身世险，一窗春梦送轻舠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5571,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孙?第一百二十一","author":"文天祥","text":"故人有孙宰，义均骨肉地。\n连为粪土丛，挥手洒衰泪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5572,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"尘外","author":"文天祥","text":"半山风雨截江城，未脱人间总是尘。\n中夜起看衣上月，青天如水露华新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5573,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扬子江","author":"文天祥","text":"几日随风北海游，回从扬子大江头。\n臣心一片磁针石，不指南方不肯休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5574,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扬州城下赋","author":"文天祥","text":"黯云霜雾暗扶桑，半壁东南尽雪霜。\n壮气不随天地变，笑骑飞鹤入维扬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5575,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次妹第一百五十五","author":"文天祥","text":"天际伤愁别，江山憔悴人。\n团圆思弟妹，传语故乡春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5576,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江丞相万里第四十五","author":"文天祥","text":"星拆台衡地，斯文去矣休。\n湖光与天远，屈注沧江流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5577,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江州第十二","author":"文天祥","text":"戎马暗天宇，落日九江流。\n元恶迷是似，化作黄长虬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5578,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江行第八十七","author":"文天祥","text":"萧萧白杨路，死人积如丘。\n大江东流去，苍山旌旆愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5579,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江行第八十九","author":"文天祥","text":"朔风飘胡雁，江城带素月。\n安得覆八溟，滂沱洗吴越。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5580,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江行第八十五","author":"文天祥","text":"畏途随长江，万里沧茫水。\n游子去日长，壮心不肯已。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5581,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江行第八十六","author":"文天祥","text":"江水东流去，浮云终日行。\n别离经死地，饮啄愧残生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5582,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江陵第二十四","author":"文天祥","text":"闻说江陵府，今又降元戎。\n甲外控鸣镝，肩舆强老翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5583,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪事 其一","author":"文天祥","text":"三宫九庙事方危，狼子心肠未可知。\n若使无人折狂虏，东南那个是男儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5584,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪事 其三","author":"文天祥","text":"单骑堂堂诣虏营，古今祸福了如陈。\n北方相顾称男子，似谓江南尚有人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5585,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪事","author":"文天祥","text":"狼心那顾歃铜盘，舌在纵横击可汗。\n自分身为齑粉碎，虏中方作丈夫看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5586,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪事 其二","author":"文天祥","text":"虎头牌子织金裳，北面三年蚁梦长。\n借问一门朱与紫，江南几世谢君王。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5587,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪事 其二","author":"文天祥","text":"春秋人物类能言，宗国常因口舌存。\n我亦濒危专对出，北风满野负乾坤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5588,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪事 其一","author":"文天祥","text":"不拚一死报封疆，忍使湖山牧虎狼。\n当日本为妻子计，而今何面见三光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5589,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪事 其六","author":"文天祥","text":"英雄未肯死前休，风起云飞不自由。\n杀我混同江外去，岂无曹翰守幽州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5590,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪事 其五","author":"文天祥","text":"慷慨轻身堕蒺藜，羝羊生乳是归期。\n岂无从史私袁盎，恨我从前少侍儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5591,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪事 其四","author":"文天祥","text":"麟笔严于首恶书，我将口舌击奸谀。\n虽非周勃安刘手，不愧当年产禄诛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5592,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪事 其三","author":"文天祥","text":"枭獍何堪共劝酬，衣冠涂炭可胜羞。\n袖中若有击贼笏，便使凶渠面血流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5593,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自淮归浙东第六十一","author":"文天祥","text":"北走惊险难，十步一回首。\n碧海吹衣裳，挂席上南斗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5594,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]